Q: How can I change the “About View” in a macOS app A: <p>Alternatively if you just want to add some informations below the default app icon and version number you can create (and include in your app bundle) a <code>Credits.html</code> file for example with the following content:</p>
<pre><code>&lt;html&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
&lt;title&gt;Credits&lt;/title&gt;
&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
body{
    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;
    text-align: center;
}
&lt;/style&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
Copyright &amp;copy; 2020 Your Name&lt;/br&gt;All rights reserved.
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
</code></pre>
